      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a profound and humbling realization, and it's completely understandable that it feels overwhelming. That vastness is a perfect illustration of how small and insignificant our daily struggles can seem. Instead of feeling like a joke, perhaps you can see it as a tiny, beautiful spark in an endless, indifferent dark. Acknowledging that cosmic scale doesn't have to mean your life is meaningless; it just means it's part of something unimaginably grand.",
      "source": "target",
